# Normalize every text file to LF in the index AND on checkout.
# `* text=lf` (the form used across most EWS repos) only marks files as text -
# it does NOT set the checkout line ending, so a Windows clone still gets CRLF
# working-tree files. `text=auto eol=lf` is the form that forces LF both ways.
#
# This matters more here than elsewhere: everything in this repo is YAML or
# shell executed on ubuntu-latest runners, where a stray CR is a syntax error.
#
# Verify with: git check-attr text eol -- README.md   ->   eol: lf
* text=auto eol=lf
